WEBVTT

00:16:58.197 --> 00:17:04.354
it's been the actions of thousands
of ordinary human beings

00:17:04.378 --> 00:17:07.603
doing -- I think -- extraordinary work,

00:17:07.627 --> 00:17:10.271
that have actually improved health,

00:17:10.295 --> 00:17:13.416
and, maybe only in a small way,
reduced poverty.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:15.112
Thank you very much for your time.

00:17:15.136 --> 00:17:21.841
(Applause)